ound:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Threats_Old_and_New\" title=\"Threats Old and New\">Threats Old and New</a></b>, Raid Warded chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Impulse\" title=\"Impulse\">Impulse +162</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Impulse\" title=\"Impulse\">Impulse +162</a>:</b> Passive: +162 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Force, Untyped, Slashing, Piercing, and Bludgeoning <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Kinetic Lore +24%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Kinetic Lore +24</a>:</b> Passive: Your Force, Physical and Untyped spells gain a 24% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Power_in_Pact\" title=\"Power in Pact\"> Power in Pact +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Power_in_Pact\" title=\"Power in Pact\"> Power in Pact +3</a>:</b> You gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Pact_Dice\" title=\"Pact Dice\">Pact Dice</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sealed_in_Undeath\" title=\"Sealed in Undeath\">Sealed in Undeath</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sealed_in_Undeath\" title=\"Sealed in Undeath\">Sealed in Undeath</a>:</b> This item seethes with a sealed power. It can have its power unsealed at the <a href=\"/page/Ritual_Table#Sealed_in_Undeath_clothing_/_jewelry_upgrades\" title=\"Ritual Table\">Ritual Table</a>, adding one effect. Attempting to add another will remove the original.<br /><br />Effect options: <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +15</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +15</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"> Dexterity +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"> Dexterity +15</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dexterity.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +15</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"> Wisdom +15</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></s