elligence\">Insightful Intelligence +7</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Insightful Intelligence +7</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +7 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +7</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Insightful Wisdom +7</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +7 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Wisdom.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Insightful Charisma +7</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Insightful Charisma +7</a></b>: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +7 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Charisma.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Quality Strength +3</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Quality Strength +3</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span><wbr />&#32;•&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Quality Constitution +3</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a hre